id: bootloader_custom_size
label: Bootloader Custom Size
package: bootloader
description: >
    The Bootloader Custom Size component can be used to alter the allocated space for the main bootloader
    to create custom-sized bootloaders by altering the value of "bootloader_main_size".
category: Platform|Bootloader
quality: internal
provides:
  - name: bootloader_custom_size
define:
  - name: BOOTLOADER_CUSTOM_SIZE
    value: 1
template_contribution:
  - name: bootloader_main_size
    value: -8192
metadata:
    sbom:
        license: MSLA
root_path: bootloader
